conduct.body:
You must not:
• harass, insult, threaten or discriminate against other users, in chat, usernames, bios or avatars;
• post illegal, hateful or pornographic content, or spam;
• cheat in quizzes or tamper with rankings;
• try to access other people’s accounts, bypass protections, attack or overload the platform, or scrape it automatically.
You can block any user who bothers you.
